{"ts":"2026-09-10T22:05:05.431Z","author":"pi-agent","author_source":"asserted","agent_harness":"pi","agent_model":"glm-5.2:cloud","agent_model_source":"environment","agent_instance":"8271f1a075b38c0ea5a160ac","agent_provenance":{"model":{"value":"glm-5.2:cloud","source":"environment"},"effort":null,"role":null,"topic":null},"op":"comment_add","patch":[{"op":"replace","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-09-10T22:05:05.431Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/comments","value":[{"created_at":"2026-09-10T22:05:05.431Z","author":"pi-agent","text":"Delivered: promotion.ts is a pure fail-closed statistically bounded promotion gate (Hoeffding inequality over bounded-reward sample evidence). It enforces that a candidate is promoted ONLY when its held-out lower confidence bound exceeds the incumbent's upper bound by the effect threshold, with confidence 1-alpha over at least minSamples episodes, and the held-out set is isolated from training (contamination verdict null). Default is NO. Integrated into bandit.ts: the recursive loop now draws seeded held-out evaluation episodes and gates each promotion through decidePromotion, recording every refusal reason on the generation receipt (refusalReason) so the generations array is the auditable lineage. Adversarial tests in test/promotion.test.ts (19 tests) and test/bandit.test.ts (4 new gate tests) cover: no evidence -> refused; wrong generation -> refused; contaminated held-out -> refused; single lucky sample below minSamples -> refused; genuine statistically sound improvement -> promoted; regression -> refused with reason; minimize direction; transitive invalidation via existing buildLineageAncestry; determinism. Revert-check: neutering decidePromotion to always-promote turns 14 promotion tests RED (5 pass: pure parse/bound helpers + deterministic + transitive invalidation, which do not depend on the refusal behaviour). Coverage 100/100/100/100, docstrings 100%, no any, no inline await import, erasable TS only."}]}],"before_hash":"8327b7da9948acf9035ad3affbd2bc7f2b6006d7788f63638d9ddceb1a55285b","after_hash":"034cf393439533b5461855651fe1db16deddf9b523142269537d52c3ab2cee2c","item_hash_version":3,"event_class":"substantive","record_hash_version":1,"record_hash":"4e824c14b4e2186fc1299c5048a3c2f5bc5679b5555383b76ff3cde8fd5c2479"}
